-Notes on working of code\
	-width and maxHeight do not seem to work in same frame modifier\
	-List don't work inside ScrollView\
	-Identifiable is used to build list items which do not lead to any state change, while Hashable is used to build list items which trigger state change and lead to UI update\
	-The order of modifiers is important in SwiftUI, the UI will look different if order is different\
	-MVVM is not suitable with SwiftUI, as swiftUI has many features like property wrappers like environment, state, appStorage\
\
-Notes on Xcode\
	-Xcode do not support live-reload or hot-reload on simulator, do add this functionality I tried Alcatraz (dependency manager for XCode), which also did not work properly\
\
-All SwiftUI views are put here for in case if they get lost in co-pilot\
